# Science data products (raw HDF5 granules, derived rasters, browse images)
# and the Python virtualenv must never be committed — and Tailwind 4's
# automatic content scanner respects these ignores (a 2.58 GB granule in
# data/raw once OOM-killed the dev server's CSS build).
# NOTE: /data/* (not /data/) so that recorded real-analysis results can be
# re-included below — git cannot re-include files under a fully excluded dir.
/data/*
!/data/derived/
/data/derived/*
# Exception: the recorded real-analysis result is a small (~6 KB) first-class
# story artifact and must survive fresh clones.
!/data/derived/nisar-mojave-2026/
!/data/derived/nisar-mojave-2026/recorded_run.json
/tools/venv/

server.log
# Skills directory
/skills/